<description>&lt;p&gt;Thailand is confronting multiple security and environmental pressures, including a bomb explosion in its southern region that prompted police to tighten border security and the air force to scramble F-16s, and an explosion at an oil facility in Bangkok that injured nine people. The government is also facing cross-border tensions as Cambodia formally protested a Thai road expansion in Oddar Meanchey and both countries agreed to a UN-backed maritime site visit, while Thailand and Myanmar are pressing each other over arsenic contamination from Shan State mines. Mining pollution is disrupting the Festival of Lights and prompting joint monitoring efforts, and a Japanese aid worker called for better integration of Myanmar migrants. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNcUpsRzU0UGYxVkZCSEoxZEswM1VjdHJqYWRtNFlIdHBUSy1XWVdXeXV6d3hFYktIR3Z0VGtPeW5YSkYwZDhoallmLUVnbjVBeW5jSnZwb2plU2tEQjNSX1hBbGxoc0FtVVotRVlubDR0YVNRTzUyMGRqWEFsMWNJT0RYXzRwNWxyWXpvdnVHeWpZU05oZWJfc0pUZEE2cU0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQYlJ1N1VEYW02NllIbUNfaW1xQ09NQlp1TFJSVndWcmZrbTdmZWFQd2p3R1F3VE9kZFUzQzMyREdLanRHRllfVTRNTEgzdHJBNWl2T3dDbzZLdmtFSWcwT3d6R1MtQUk3dHM4am1MVFhweFZHT0VwZ2MtNEIwY2k1RnhkQ2pqM3c2YVJoNHBNYnZQRDh0czdmcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mining.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQaUVNeFBSUV81ZjRfVzJqUDMtU29XZ3pBR0N1cVRpSVdmQU5SNHNwMzBOYkxSYmRrSkJmdXNqczRtNFNheHo0RWpVX3Y0QXQ2eXd3WUZ1bGpkNW9EZGVZX3dJX3RjUWU5anNXbUIyUF94OFd0Z3JfYWxaZ0FZb0U3QVRUOUZCMEhPalJPYWtUc2VEN195V0x6YTZOYzlqV1RFSG9hUTdHeUdzR0Q5bWJObk13N2FOX21YYk5hTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a